About this material
-------------------

Teaching material prepared and authored by Miguel Angel Luque-Fernández
(Departamento de Estadística e Investigación Operativa, Universidad de Granada).

The structure and didactic approach of the syllabus draw on the "Metodología
Científica" course of the Máster Universitario en Neurociencias Básicas,
Aplicadas y Dolor (Universidad de Granada), originally taught by
J. L. Romero-Béjar (2022). The slides, figures, examples, R code and
bibliography in this repository have been reworked, extended and re-authored
for the Quarto RevealJS and Beamer formats.

